/**
 * Hand-authored kana curriculum.
 *
 * Source data is hiragana only; katakana is generated by `toKatakana`. Rōmaji is
 * Hepburn, with Kunrei spellings in `alts` for typing mode. Mnemonics are shown
 * only when an item is missed (see the on-miss policy in docs/DECISIONS.md).
 */

